rite into the spec\n\n- `residency: 'prefix' | 'rail'` on every contribution in the receipt, so the trajectory view and the audit answer show one unified list.\n- Steps 1–5 above as a normative requirement — the extension contract a new context feature is written against.\n- Storage stays two-shaped, with the reasons above recorded so nobody re-proposes merging them.\n\nDoes that give you the unified extensible layer you're after, or do you want the prefix contributions decomposed further than \"one rendered artifact + its hashes\"?",
